             60  * CONVERT DECIMAL TO INTEGER
             61  *       BLWP @CVDIZ
             62  *         16-BIT OVERFLOW - FP # IN FPAC
             63  *         NO NUMBER
             64  *         (HEX ON CVDIF)
             65  *         NUMBER
             66  *
             67  *  IN   R7 = PTR
             68  *  OUT  R0 = DELIMITER
             69  *       R1 = 16-BIT 2'S COMPLEMENT INTEGER
             70  *       R7 = NEW PTR
