            262  * CVDB20:-  GETS THE NEXT DIGIT IF THERE
            263  *           IS ONE.  LEADING BLANKS ARE SKIPPED.
            264  *           IF THE NEXT CHARACTER IS A NON-DIGIT
            265  *           THEN RETURN IS MADE TO THE FIRST
            266  *           INSTRUCTION FOLLOWING THE CALL.  IF
            267  *           THE NEXT CHARACTER IS A DIGIT, A
            268  *           RETURN IS TAKEN TO THE SECOND
            269  *           INSTRUCTION FOLLOWING THE CALL.
            270  *
            271  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
            272  *
            273  *       BL @CVDB20
            274  *
            275  *       IN -    R7 = POINTER
            276  *       OUT -   R0 = CHARACTER
            277  *
            278  *       NORMAL EXIT - RETURN + 1 ON DIGIT
            279  *                       RETURN ON NON-DIGIT
            280  *
0174 04C0   281  CVDB20 CLR  R0                GET DIGIT
0176 D037   282         MOVB *R7+,R0           GET NEXT CHARACTER
0178 130C   283         JEQ  CVDB22            EOL
017A 0280   284         CI   R0,>2000          BLANK?
017C 2000 
017E 13FA   285         JEQ  CVDB20            Y
0180 0280   286         CI   R0,>3000          <"0?
0182 3000 
0184 1A06   287         JL   CVDB22            Y
0186 0280   288         CI   R0,>3900          >"9?
0188 3900 
018A 1B03   289         JH   CVDB22            Y
018C 0A40   290         SLA  R0,4
018E 09C0   291         SRL  R0,12             RIGHT JUSTIFY CHARACTER
0190 05CB   292         INCT R11
0192 045B   293  CVDB22 RT   RETURN
